name: Inspect a large diagram and scan its tail through triage, report and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: run threat-model:import {"path":".kuzushi/manual-context.json","label":"Large","activate":true}
require-live-snap: 30 threat-model:import saved | imported
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-summary
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART mapped
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | ready-summary
nav-mode:
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 Tail worker 095 | last-summary-component
keys: Enter z
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | tail-diagram
expect: Tail worker 095
expect: Worker 094
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | tail-160x48
expect: Worker 094
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | tail-96x89
expect: Worker 094
expect: ▲ Declared transfer 095
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | tail-80x24
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | tail-60x20
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 s plan scan | tail-40x12
expect: f findings
ask: Does the tail component beyond the former 64-element cutoff retain its flow, evidence, selection and scoped actions across all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: s
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | tail-study
expect: 1 exact source path
expect: No jobs started
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | canceled-study-return
expect: Tail worker 095
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART canceled-draft
keys: s
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | new-tail-study
keys: Home Down Down Down Down Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Draft ready | fixed-tail-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval-terms
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 1
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | exact-approval
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | explicit-launch
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | complete
expect-not: Ledger refresh failed
expect: Severity cutoff: not configured
expect: Owned policy marker needs an owner decision
expect: Equivalence:
expect-not: security disabled
expect-not: blocking 0
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 Severity cutoff: not configured | outcome-160x48
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 Severity cutoff: not configured | outcome-96x89
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 work finished | outcome-80x24
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-80x24-page
resize: 60x20
keys: g
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 work finished | outcome-60x20
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-60x20-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-60x20-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-60x20-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-60x20-page-4
resize: 40x12
keys: g
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 work finished | outcome-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-5
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-6
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-7
keys: NPage
live-snap: outcome-40x12-page-8
resize: 120x36
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 Severity cutoff: not configured | outcome-return
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed-screen
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 s plan scan | exact-diagram-return
expect: Tail worker 095
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | selected-scan
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-tail.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 OWNER_POLICY_REVIEW | tail-finding
expect-not: live source missing or changed
submit: decision deferred Owned tail source inspection
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Evidence: 3 producer observations | faithful-report
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | export-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the diagram launch only three approved tail-file jobs, retain three observations under one deferred identity and export the exact context, source and spending without scanning other modules?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Evidence: 3 producer observations | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_dfd.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the completed fixed plan, exact tail finding, deferred decision, source and unused protected Review capacity without any new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
